164
00:13:58,283 --> 00:14:10,329
[SPEAKER_00]: TAB, Tila Duhaime): homes on those lots they wouldn't if they were knocked down, they would not be able to be rebuilt, but the existing non conformance or me, I mean maybe I don't even want to go to right now.

